Credits

The cloud shadow technique (the sun's transmittance through the cloud layer
baked into a map that follows the camera and darkens the ground beneath the
clouds) is credited to Dropside, of the Terrain3D community.

This is an AI-assisted project, developed with Claude (Anthropic).

addons/sky_3d is Sky3D v2.1.0 (Cory Petkovsek and contributors, J. Cuellar),
unmodified, included as a git submodule of the upstream repository
(thirdparty/Sky3D, symlinked to addons/sky_3d), under its own MIT licence: addons/sky_3d/LICENSE.txt and
addons/sky_3d/shaders/LICENSE, with third-party notices for its assets in
addons/sky_3d/ThirdParty.md.
